---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 8, 2026';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How Vehicle GearUp collects, uses, and safeguards your data when you visit our website."
	icon="lock"
	accent="violet"
	eyebrow="Your data, plainly explained"
	lead="What we collect, why we collect it, and the choices you have. No legal fog."
	updated={lastUpdated}
	toc
>
	<div class="cards">
		<div class="card"><div class="ico">🚫</div><h3>We don't sell your data</h3><p>We never sell, rent, or trade your personal information.</p></div>
		<div class="card"><div class="ico">🍪</div><h3>You control cookies</h3><p>Choose your cookie preferences in the consent banner, or in your browser.</p></div>
		<div class="card"><div class="ico">✉️</div><h3>Ask us anything</h3><p>Request access, correction, or deletion at support@vehiclegearup.com.</p></div>
	</div>

	<p>
		At <strong>Vehicle GearUp</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data when you visit or interact with our website. By using Vehicle GearUp, you agree to the terms outlined in this policy.
	</p>

	<h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
	<p>When you visit or use Vehicle GearUp, we may collect the following types of information:</p>

	<h3>a) Personal information</h3>
	<p>You may provide personal information when you:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Contact us by email</li>
		<li>Send us feedback, corrections, or collaboration requests</li>
	</ul>
	<p>This information may include your:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Name</li>
		<li>Email address</li>
		<li>Anything else you choose to include in your message</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>b) Non-personal information</h3>
	<p>We also collect non-personal information automatically through website analytics tools, which may include:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>IP address</li>
		<li>Browser type and version</li>
		<li>Pages visited and time spent on the website</li>
		<li>Referral sources and links clicked</li>
	</ul>
	<p>This information helps us <strong>improve website performance, user experience, and content relevance</strong>.</p>

	<h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
	<p>Vehicle GearUp uses the collected information to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Provide the guides and content you request</li>
		<li>Improve website functionality and user experience</li>
		<li>Monitor website performance and trends</li>
		<li>Respond to inquiries, questions, or customer support requests</li>
	</ul>
	<p>We do <strong>not sell, rent, or trade</strong> your personal information to third parties.</p>

	<h2>3. Cookies &amp; tracking</h2>
	<p>We show a cookie consent banner so you can accept or decline non-essential cookies before any analytics or advertising tracking runs.</p>
	<p>Vehicle GearUp uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Enhance website functionality</li>
		<li>Remember your preferences, such as light or dark mode</li>
		<li>Analyze traffic and user behavior</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		You can <strong>disable cookies</strong> through your browser settings, but some features of the website may not function properly if cookies are turned off.
	</p>

	<h2>4. Third-party services</h2>
	<p>
		Our website may contain links to third-party websites, affiliate programs, or service providers. These third parties may collect data independently of Vehicle GearUp.
	</p>
	<p>
		We are not responsible for the <strong>privacy practices or content</strong> of external websites. We encourage you to read their privacy policies before interacting with them.
	</p>

	<h2>5. Affiliate marketing</h2>
	<p>
		Vehicle GearUp is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and may join other affiliate programs. If you click on affiliate links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate partnerships <strong>do not influence our reviews or recommendations</strong>. Learn more on our <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure page</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>6. Data security</h2>
	<p>
		We take the protection of your personal information seriously. Vehicle GearUp implements <strong>appropriate technical and organizational measures</strong> to safeguard your data from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.
	</p>
	<p>However, no method of data transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

	<h2>7. Children's privacy</h2>
	<p>
		Vehicle GearUp is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us to have it removed.
	</p>

	<h2>8. Your rights</h2>
	<p>You have the right to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
		<li>Request corrections to inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
		<li>Opt-out of marketing communications</li>
		<li>Request deletion of your personal data, subject to legal and operational requirements</li>
	</ul>
	<p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@vehiclegearup.com"><strong>support@vehiclegearup.com</strong></a>.</p>

	<h2>9. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
	<p>
		Vehicle GearUp reserves the right to update or modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with the "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the website constitutes acceptance of any changes.
	</p>

	<h2>10. Contact us</h2>
	<p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact us at:</p>
	<p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@vehiclegearup.com">support@vehiclegearup.com</a></p>
</StaticPage>
